    (property "ki_description" "The ISL9120 and ISL9120IR are highly integrated buck-boost switching regulators that accept input voltages either above or below the regulated output voltage. The regulator automatically transitions between buck and boost modes without significant output disturbance. They also have automatic bypass functionality. When the input voltage is generally within 1% to 2% of the output voltage, there will be a direct bypass connection between the VIN and VOUT pins.In addition to the automatic bypass functionality, " (at 26.67 -284.76 0)
